<sect1 id="fd" xreflabel="fd-&fd-version;">
  <?dbhtml filename="fd.html"?>

  <title>fd-&fd-version;</title>

  <indexterm zone="fd">
    <primary sortas="a-fd">fd</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduksjon til fd</title>

    <para>
      fd pakken tilbyr et enkelt, raskt og brukervennlig alternativ til
      <command>find</command>.
    </para>

    &build-use-network;

    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Nedlasting: <ulink url="&fd-download;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">fd Avhengigheter</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Påkrevd</bridgehead>
    <para role="required">
      <ulink url="&blfs-svn;/general/rust.html">Rustc</ulink>
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Anbefalt</bridgehead>
    <para role="recommended">
      <!-- https://github.com/sharkdp/fd/pull/481 -->
      <xref linkend="jemalloc"/> (for forbedret ytelse)
    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installasjon av fd</title>

    <para>
      Eksporter først noen miljøvariabler for å muliggjøre kobling mot 
      systemets <filename class="libraryfile">libjemalloc</filename>:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>export CARGO_FEATURE_UNPREFIXED_MALLOC_ON_SUPPORTED_PLATFORMS=1 &amp;&amp;
export JEMALLOC_OVERRIDE=/usr/lib/libjemalloc.so</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Installer fd ved å kjøre følgende kommandoer:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>cargo build --release</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      For å kjøre testpakken, utsted: <command>cargo test --release</command>.
    </para>

    <para>
      Nå, som &root; bruker:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>install -vDm755 target/release/fd -t /usr/bin/</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Installer manualsidene som &root; bruker, hvis ønskelig:
    </para>

<screen remap="doc" role="root"><userinput>install -vDm644 doc/fd.1 -t /usr/share/man/man1/</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Hvis du ønsker å installere skallkompletteringer, utfør de relevante 
      kommandoene for skallet/skallene dine som &root; bruker:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>target/release/fd --gen-completions bash | install -vDm644 /dev/stdin /usr/share/bash-completions/completions/fd
target/release/fd --gen-completions fish | install -vDm644 /dev/stdin /usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/fd.fish
target/release/fd --gen-completions zsh  | install -vDm644 /dev/stdin /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_fd</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Til slutt, fjern de tidligere eksporterte miljøvariablene:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>unset CARGO_FEATURE_UNPREFIXED_MALLOC_ON_SUPPORTED_PLATFORMS &amp;&amp;
unset JEMALLOC_OVERRIDE</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">
    <title>Parameterforklaringer</title>

    <para>
      <command>cargo build --release --no-default-features --features=completions</command>:
      Denne alternative kommandoen bygger fd uten jemalloc.
    </para>

    <para>
      <!-- https://github.com/tikv/jemallocator/issues/19 -->
      <!-- https://github.com/tikv/jemallocator/blob/0e9129157d261cf6bda86d5dcd9eba94f3cd0f96/jemalloc-sys/README.md?plain=1#L179-L182 -->
      <!-- https://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php?title=Rust_package_guidelines&oldid=878431#Unbundling_C/C++_libraries -->
      <envar>CARGO_FEATURE_UNPREFIXED_MALLOC_ON_SUPPORTED_PLATFORMS=1</envar>,
      <envar>JEMALLOC_OVERRIDE=/usr/lib/libjemalloc.so</envar>:
      Disse miljøvariablene tillater bygging mot systemets
      <filename class="libraryfile">libjemalloc</filename>.
      Hvis den ikke er angitt, brukes et leverandørbasert statisk bibliotek.
    </para>

  </sect2>

